{"title":"Ogre Elder","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"q-alert-banner gg-alert\" role=\"note\"><svg class=\"q-alert-ico\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3 2 21h20z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"M12 10v5M12 17.6v.4\" stroke=\"#1b1300\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg><span>It lives on <b>Ogre Isle</b>, which you can only reach after finishing <a href=\"#/guide/quest-plymouth-the-ogre-traitor\">The Ogre Traitor</a> (Gerald Seabroden).</span></p><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 46 Ogre that attacks with crush (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">freeze</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">shock</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">stab</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 2 times (0.9% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/ogre-bone-needle\">Ogre Bone Needle</a> <span class=\"muted\">(rerolls quality)</span>. A small chance on any kill, far better from elites. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-elder\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-elder?lv=45\">Lv 45 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-elder?lv=46\">Lv 46 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-elder?lv=47\">Lv 47 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-elder?lv=48\">Lv 48 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-elder?lv=49\">Lv 49 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-elder?lv=50\">Lv 50 <span>1</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ogre-elder?lv=45\" title=\"Pick level 45\"><td><b>45</b></td><td>243</td><td>29.3</td><td>2,250</td><td class=\"muted\">729 · 41 · 6,750</td><td>1</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Ogre%20Cove\">Ogre Cove</a></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/ogre-elder\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>46</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>254</td><td>29.8</td><td>2,300</td><td class=\"muted\">762 · 41.7 · 6,900</td><td>1</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ogre-elder?lv=47\" title=\"Pick level 47\"><td><b>47</b></td><td>266</td><td>30.4</td><td>2,350</td><td class=\"muted\">798 · 42.6 · 7,050</td><td>1</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ogre-elder?lv=48\" title=\"Pick level 48\"><td><b>48</b></td><td>278</td><td>30.9</td><td>2,400</td><td class=\"muted\">834 · 43.3 · 7,200</td><td>1</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ogre-elder?lv=49\" title=\"Pick level 49\"><td><b>49</b></td><td>290</td><td>31.5</td><td>2,450</td><td class=\"muted\">870 · 44.1 · 7,350</td><td>1</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ogre-elder?lv=50\" title=\"Pick level 50\"><td><b>50</b></td><td>303</td><td>32</td><td>2,500</td><td class=\"muted\">909 · 44.8 · 7,500</td><td>1</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 4 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - in 0% of 4 looted corpses, 160 recorded drops, 6,316 total, 15–140 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0% · 0/4</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"ogrewax-knick\" title=\"Ogrewax Knick - in 100% of 4 looted corpses, 4 recorded drops, 4 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/b734a810757d0d5d1409.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogrewax Knick</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">100% · 4/4</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"titanium-spikedhelm\" title=\"Titanium Spikedhelm - in 25% of 4 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/d5811b3a9c08738a6f02.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Titanium Spikedhelm</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">25% · 1/4</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Percentages are of the corpses whose loot the collector recorded, so kills you did not loot are not counted.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Ogre%20Cove\">Ogre Cove</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 139 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around 352, -534 <span class=\"muted\">· 3 spots</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"ogre-elder\">Show on map</button>\n      <h2>Named ones <span class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:14px\">(1)</span></h2><div class=\"named-grid\"><a class=\"named-card\" href=\"#/npc/ogre-patriarch\"><img src=\"data/img/20febc0ea063f03a8efa.webp\" alt=\"\"><b>Ogre Patriarch</b><span>Lv 50</span></a></div>\n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Ogre: <a href=\"#/monster/ogre-youth\">Ogre Youth</a> <span class=\"muted\">(30)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/ogre-gaunt\">Gaunt Ogre</a> <span class=\"muted\">(33)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/ogre\">Ogre</a> <span class=\"muted\">(35)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/ogre-mauler\">Ogre Mauler</a> <span class=\"muted\">(38)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/ogre-butcher\">Ogre Butcher</a> <span class=\"muted\">(40)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/ogre-charger\">Ogre Charger</a> <span class=\"muted\">(42)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/ogre-shaman\">Ogre Shaman</a> <span class=\"muted\">(44)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/ogre-mountain\">Mountain Ogre</a> <span class=\"muted\">(50)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/ogre-warchief\">Ogre Warchief</a> <span class=\"muted\">(54)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/6b8e9887508499fc36f7.webp\" alt=\"Ogre Elder\"></div><h3>Ogre Elder</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td><b>46</b> <span class=\"muted\">(picked · base 46)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Ogre</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>crush · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>254</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>29.8</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>2,300</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>4.4 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>2</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><th>Pendant / cape</th><td>Can drop</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>219 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}